<title>HONG KONG: Assoc Int'l Hotels H1 profit up 13.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Assoc Int'l Hotels H1 profit up 13.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 28.7   vs 25.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  6.5    vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			  103.30 vs 91.11</p>
<p>    Turnover		   290.53 vs 265.31</p>
<p>    Company name	     Associated International Hotels Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		January 14-21</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 January 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Associated Int'l Hotels is a hotel operator.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
